439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (The CUDA kernel achieves massive speedups \(244x--492x\) because the Tesla T4 GPU has 2560 CUDA cores operating in parallel, compared to 2 CPU threads. However, when including PCIe data transfer overhead, the effective speedup drops to 37x--45x. This demonstrates that for this workload, data transfer is the primary bottleneck, not computation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
