endobj
505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 85 0 R
/T (The CUDA kernel speedup of 492x on the Large dataset drops to only 38x when including Host-to-Device and Device-to-Host PCIe data transfers. For this workload, over 92% of the total GPU time is spent on data transfer, not computation. This is a textbook example of a memory-transfer-bound workload where the computation-to-communication ratio is too low to fully exploit GPU parallelism. The convolution performs only approximately 10 arithmetic operations per pixel but requires transferring 1 byte in and 1 byte out per pixel.)
/E (The CUDA kernel speedup of 492x on the Large dataset drops to only 38x when including Host-to-Device and Device-to-Host PCIe data transfers. For this workload, over 92% of the total GPU time is spent on data transfer, not computation. This is a textbook example of a memory-transfer-bound workload where the computation-to-communication ratio is too low to fully exploit GPU parallelism. The convolution performs only approximately 10 arithmetic operations per pixel but requires transferring 1 byte in and 1 byte out per pixel.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
