529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (The Medium dataset's anomalously low OpenMP speedup \(1.09x\) compared to Small \(1.67x\) and Large \(1.48x\) suggests cache contention. The approximately 16 MB combined working set \(8 MB input + 8 MB output\) exceeds the L2 cache capacity of the Colab VM's Xeon processor. When multiple threads access different regions of this data, they cause frequent cache line evictions, reducing effective memory bandwidth. The Optimized version mitigates this by reading only 5 \(instead of 9\) values per pixel.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
