/Title (The contiguous inner column loop operates on sequential memory addresses. By annotating it with #pragma omp simd and compiling with -mavx2, the compiler generates 256-bit vector instructions that process 8 pixels \(8-bit unsigned integers packed into 32-bit integers\) per instruction cycle.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 912 0 R
/Prev 1067 0 R
>>
